{
----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
    Filename:       NRF24L01-SpeedTest-TX.spin2
    Description:    Speed test for nRF24L01+ modules
        * TX Mode
    Author:         Jesse Burt
    Started:        Apr 30, 2020
    Updated:        Aug 26, 2024
    Copyright (c) 2024 - See end of file for terms of use.
